    <briefdescription>
<para>One-time user input waiting mechanism for WshShell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module allows the shell to temporarily override normal input handling to wait for a specific key press (e.g., &lt;Enter&gt;, Y/N confirmation, etc.).</para>
<para>Once the input is received, the registered callback is executed, and normal shell behavior resumes.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Whoosh Embedded Team </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="copyright"><para>Copyright (c) 2025 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
